(Hou turns to page one of the booklet,
<<pause_dialogue>>
She reads the description I revised word by word under Master Shao’s kindly but unmistakable pressure.
She handles the lenticular card I made as if it were a small curiosity, tilting it up and down.
// Pause the communication interface here; resume the dialogue after Space.
<<pause_dialogue>>
